BugInfo.Description:
在hash加密的过程，缺少必要的步骤，会削弱所生成hash值的强度。  

**例如**：下列代码片段中，缺少`MessageDigest.update()`的调用，导致创建不基于任何数据的hash值。  
```java
...  
MessageDigest messageDigest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-512");  
//messageDigest.update(inputText.getBytes());   //lack of necessary steps  
byte byteBuffer[] = messageDigest.digest();  
StringBuilder strHexString = new StringBuilder();    
for (int i = 0; i < byteBuffer.length; i++) {  
    String hex = Integer.toHexString(0xff & byteBuffer[i]);    
    if (hex.length() == 1) {  
        strHexString.append('0');    
    }  
    strHexString.append(hex);    
}    
strResult = strHexString.toString();    
...
```

BugInfo.Advice:
在hash加密的过程，执行所有必需的步骤，确保不会削弱所生成hash值的强度。  

**例如**：下列代码片段中，添加`MessageDigest.update()`的调用。  
```java
...  
MessageDigest messageDigest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-512");   
messageDigest.update(inputText.getBytes());     
byte byteBuffer[] = messageDigest.digest();    
StringBuilder strHexString = new StringBuilder();  
for (int i = 0; i < byteBuffer.length; i++) {  
    String hex = Integer.toHexString(0xff & byteBuffer[i]);    
    if (hex.length() == 1) {  
        strHexString.append('0');    
    }  
    strHexString.append(hex);    
}    
strResult = strHexString.toString();    
...
```
